{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00488","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 二 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑帝旋驭，青躔导日。\n金籙上玄，玉堂初吉。\n钩陈夕次，銮和先跸。\n蔼蔼羣灵，昭昭咸秩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}